WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.502
Hello. Hi.

00:00:02.794 --> 00:00:05.547
I'm Dr. Shoukath Ansari,

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:09.884
an actor, performer,
and a full-time physician.

00:00:10.635 --> 00:00:14.264
You may remember me
by my role in Netflix,

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:16.433
<i>Master of None,</i>
season one,

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:19.644
for which I was snubbed
for an Emmy.

00:00:19.936 --> 00:00:23.273
And<i> Master of None,</i>
season number two;

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:25.191
again, I was snubbed.

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:28.653
My son, Aziz,
asked me to come here

00:00:28.737 --> 00:00:33.783
to talk about a new stand-up
special coming in Netflix,

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:38.204
but something more important
I need to talk to you about:

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:40.165
Colon cancer.

00:00:40.248 --> 00:00:44.210
Colon cancer is
number two killer in America.

00:00:44.669 --> 00:00:49.674
We can prevent it
by doing screening colonoscopy.

00:00:49.758 --> 00:00:52.677
Colonoscopy is an examination
of your large intestine.

00:00:52.761 --> 00:00:55.638
You'll drink a gallon of
solution, clean you out,

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:58.641
and pass a rubber tube
all through the butthole,

00:00:58.725 --> 00:01:01.019
examine the whole intestine.

00:01:01.102 --> 00:01:05.106
Anybody about
45 should be screened

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:09.819
if black, or white, or even
brown, doesn't matter.

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:13.072
Get an appointment
for screening colonoscopy

00:01:13.156 --> 00:01:14.866
and drop your pants.

00:01:15.283 --> 00:01:16.284
That's all.

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:17.869
Bye-bye.

00:01:20.705 --> 00:01:21.790
Did I do good?

